OL,3,GNEWSAWe sold everything and bought a
OL,4,Aone-way ticket to take our three
OL,5,Achildren travelling
OL,6,
OL,7,FDani and Tom Wooldridge worked hard to
OL,8,Ftransform a 1970s house into a beloved
OL,9,Ffamily home after they bought it about
OL,10,Fseven years ago.
OL,12,FDani, 39, a nurse, also ran an
OL,13,Faesthetics business while Tom, 38, had
OL,14,Fa construction business. Three
OL,15,Fchildren, a close extended family and
OL,16,Flots of friends. A happy life.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
