OL,3,GNEWSAWe sold everything and bought a
OL,4,Aone-way ticket to take our three
OL,5,Achildren travelling
OL,6,
OL,7,FYet in May this year, the five of them
OL,8,Fsold their possessions and home, and
OL,9,Fbought a one-way ticket heading for
OL,10,FIndonesia, with the only things they
OL,11,Fowned in the world now stowed in
OL,12,Fbackpacks in the luggage compartment.
OL,14,FWith Olivia, 12, Morgan, seven, and
OL,15,Ffour-year-old George, the Woolridges
OL,16,Fare planning to travel the world, with
OL,17,Fno endpoint in sight, hoping to see
OL,18,Fevery continent.
